<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Hire purchase: flat interest on the balance (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A {@item@} has a cash price of Ksh \( {@C0@} \). A farmer buys it on hire purchase by paying a \( {@dp@}\% \) deposit. The balance attracts simple (flat) interest at \( {@R0@}\% \) per annum and is repaid in equal monthly instalments over \( {@rd(Y0)@} \) years.</p>
<p>(a) Find the interest charged on the balance.</p>
<div>Interest \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p>(b) Find the hire purchase price.</p>
<div>Hire purchase price \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>
<p>(c) Find the monthly instalment, to 2 decimal places.</p>
<div>Monthly instalment \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Deposit and balance.</strong> \( D = \frac{ {@dp@} }{100} \times {@C0@} = {@D0@} \); balance \( = {@C0@} - {@D0@} = {@B0@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(a)</strong> Interest is charged only on the balance:</p>
\[ I = \frac{P R T}{100} = \frac{ {@B0@} \times {@R0@} \times {@rd(Y0)@} }{100} = {@r2(I0)@}. \]
<p><strong>(b)</strong> \( H = \text{deposit} + \text{balance} + \text{interest} = {@D0@} + {@B0@} + {@r2(I0)@} = {@r2(H0)@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(c)</strong> The amount paid in instalments is \( {@B0@} + {@r2(I0)@} = {@r2(B0 + I0)@} \), spread over \( 12 \times {@rd(Y0)@} = {@n0@} \) months:</p>
\[ \frac{ {@r2(B0 + I0)@} }{ {@n0@} } = {@r2(x0)@}. \]]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>3</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber/>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2025010100</text>
    </stackversion>
    <questionvariables>
      <text><![CDATA[r2(v) := if integerp(round(100*v)/100) then round(v) else float(round(100*v)/100);
rd(v) := if integerp(v) then v else float(v);
item : rand(["water pump", "milking machine", "greenhouse kit", "irrigation system", "small tractor"]);
C0 : rand([60000, 80000, 120000, 150000, 240000]);
dp : rand([20, 25, 30, 40]);
R0 : rand([8, 10, 12, 15]);
Y0 : rand([1, 3/2, 2]);
D0 : C0*dp/100;
B0 : C0 - D0;
I0 : B0*R0*Y0/100;
H0 : D0 + B0 + I0;
n0 : 12*Y0;
x0 : (B0 + I0)/n0;
w_full : C0*R0*Y0/100;                   /* interest on the full cash price */
w_months : B0*R0*n0/100;                 /* time in months */
w_inclD : H0/n0;                         /* deposit included in the instalments */]]></text>
    </questionvariables>
